    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Giant.</strong> This warrior of Orc & Goblin Tribes enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“If it ain’t loud, it ain’t a proper scrap.”<br><em>— Grimgor Ironhide</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Battlefield Doctrine, Boulder Throw, Choppa, Big Choppa, Spear, Thrown Rock, Massive Projectile / Boulder Throw, Massive Boulder Throw, Rusty Blade, Shortbow, Waaagh! Ferocity, Rapid Volley, Positional Trip. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
