    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Giant.</strong> Giant enters the field as a finished D&D 5e combatant: armor, weapons, racial disciplines, battlefield powers, and commander auras are represented as embedded Items linked to the shared compendium libraries.</p><p>Its stat line follows a D&D 5e battlefield role, with durability and defensive numbers benchmarked from PF2e creature-building expectations and translated into bounded 5e values.</p><blockquote><p>“Hit ’em hard enough and the plan sorts itself out.”<br><em>— an Orc boss</em></p></blockquote>",
